'''Li'l Homura''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] implemented in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] which can be unlocked as a Stamp Reward during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] increases her damage, range, TBA and attack animation length and grants the ability to [[Weaken|Weaken]] [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 300
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Li'l Homura
|name2 = Li'l Magical Girl Homura
|name3 = Li'l Devil Homura
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Li'l Magical Girl Homura''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Li'l Devil Homura''' when obtained from [[Nutcracker Witch]] (may drop on the 1st and 2nd stage but guaranteed on the 3rd) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Due to her low base stats, this unit is practically useless outside of her combo, [[My Very Best Friend (Combo)|My Very Best Friend]], which greatly improves the performance of those units who possess the Witch Killer ability, like the Ubers in the collab.

==='''True Form'''===
Li'l Homura's True Form doubles her attack power, which would help her if the final result wasn't so low. To add more salt to the wound, she takes almost twice the amount of time to attack again. She does get a 50% chance to weaken Dark Enemies with over 100% uptime, but due to how fast Dark enemies push and her low health, it's not a great match. By the time you get her True Form, you'd most likely already have [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], so her ability is useless.

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave|TrueClass = Combo Slave & Crowd-Controller|UltraClass=}}

